ref","first-page":"1","DOI":"10.1016\/0304-3991(89)90196-4","volume":"27","author":"Tanishiro","year":"1989","journal-title":"Ultramicroscopy"},{"key":"10.1016\/0304-3991(91)90076-I_BIB15","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","first-page":"147","DOI":"10.1080\/713818023","volume":"14","author":"Komrska","year":"1967","journal-title":"Opt. Acta"},{"key":"10.1016\/0304-3991(91)90076-I_BIB16","first-page":"111","volume":"35","author":"Ohshita","year":"1986","journal-title":"J. Electron Microsc."}],"container-title":["Ultramicroscopy"],"language":"en","link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/api.elsevier.com\/content\/article\/PII:030439919190076I?httpAccept=text\/xml","content-type":"text\/xml","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"text-mining"},{"URL":"https:\/\/api.elsevier.com\/content\/article\/PII:030439919190076I?httpAccept=text\/plain","content-type":"text\/plain","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"text-mining"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2019,4,5]],"date-time":"2019-04-05T04:52:04Z","timestamp":1554439924000},"score":114.042946,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/linkinghub.elsevier.com\/retrieve\/pii\/030439919190076I"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[1991,6]]},"references-count":16,"journal-issue":{"issue":"3-4","published-print":{"date-parts":[[1991,6]]}},"alternative-id":["030439919190076I"],"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1016\/0304-3991(91)90076-i","ISSN":["0304-3991"],"issn-type":[{"value":"0304-3991","type":"print"}],"published":{"date-parts":[[1991,6]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2022,3,30]],"date-time":"2022-03-30T17:20:17Z","timestamp":1648660817364},"reference-count":3,"publisher":"Cambridge University Press (CUP)","issue":"1","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2020,6,18]],"date-time":"2020-06-18T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1592438400000},"content-version":"unspecified","delay-in-days":10903,"URL":"https:\/\/www.cambridge.org\/core\/terms"}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["Proc. annu. meet. Electron Microsc. Soc. Am."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[1990,8,12]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>The potential advantage of an electron holography in researching the atomic structure at crystal surfaces with high spatial resolution has been reveald by using the computer simulation for the 7\u00d77 super structure rearranged on a Si(111) clean surface. In order to realize the holography of the surface, problems still remain unsolved in addition to instrumentation of a high resolutional TEM equipped with a highly coherent electron source and a high vacuum specimen chamber. The most essential one among such problems is the determination of imaging conditions necessary for restoring the image blured by the aberration of an objective lens. Especially, the amount of out-of-focus is difficult to know directly from the hologram recorded as the interference pattern of the specimen transmitted wave with the reference wave passing in a vacuum area.<\/jats:p><jats:p>Restricting to the case of a weak phase object, Franke et al. suggested the possibility of restoring the image without the knowledge of focussing condition. Electron scattering at a surface is very weak and may be considered approximately kinematical. Therefore the applicability of the Franke's method to surface structures of Si(lll) thin films was examined. As the atomic positions of the 7\u00d77 structure, DAS model was adopted, and the electron diffraction was treated dynamically with the multi-slice method. Reconstructing a wave front from a hologram, we obtain the wave function in the reciprocal space as,<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1017\/s0424820100180483","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2020,6,18]],"date-time":"2020-06-18T11:08:49Z","timestamp":1592478529000},"page":"346-347","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Surface Structure Study by High Resolution Electron Holography: Contrast Simulation"],"prefix":"10.1017","volume":"48","author":[{"given":"Takayoshi","family":"Tanji","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"Keiji","family":"Yada","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"56","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2020,6,18]]},"reference":[{"key":"S0424820100180483_ref03","volume-title":"\u201cDiffraction Physics\u201d","author":"Cowley","year":"1981"},{"key":"S0424820100180483_ref02","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/0039-6028(85)90753-8"},{"key":"S0424820100180483_ref01","first-page":"677","author":"Franke","year":"1986","journal-title":"Proc. 11th Int. Cong. on Electron Microsc, Kyoto"}],"container-title":["Proceedings, annual meeting, Electron Microscopy Society of America"],"language":"en","link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/www.cambridge.org\/core\/services\/aop-cambridge-core\/content\/view\/S0424820100180483","content-type":"unspecified","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"similarity-checking"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2020,6,18]],"date-time":"2020-06-18T11:29:00Z","timestamp":1592479740000},"score":61.68677,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/www.cambridge.org\/core\/product\/identifier\/S0424820100180483\/type\/journal_article"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[1990,8,12]]},"references-count":3,"journal-issue":{"issue":"1","published-print":{"date-parts":[[1990,8,12]]}},"alternative-id":["S0424820100180483"],"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1017\/s0424820100180483","ISSN":["0424-8201","2690-1315"],"issn-type":[{"value":"0424-8201","type":"print"},{"value":"2690-1315","type":"electronic"}],"published":{"date-parts":[[1990,8,12]]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,4]],"date-time":"2026-08-04T04:19:50Z","timestamp":1785817190436,"version":"3.56.0"},"reference-count":39,"publisher":"Elsevier BV","issue":"1","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2000,9,1]],"date-time":"2000-09-01T00:00:00Z","timestamp":967766400000},"content-version":"tdm","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"https:\/\/www.elsevier.com\/tdm\/userlicense\/1.0\